  "prompt": "How does the latest competitor price of each TV & Video product compare with Voltmarkt's own list price? Use each product's competitor check with the latest observed_ts, exactly one per product; observed_ts holds UTC time. When two checks of a product tie on observed_ts, the one whose competitor comes first alphabetically is kept. Compare its price_eur with the product's list_price_eur in price_history on the UTC day of that check: the version whose valid_from is on or before that day and whose valid_to is missing or on or after it. Return four columns, in this order: product_id, competitor_price (the check's price_eur), list_price_eur and gap_eur, competitor_price minus list_price_eur. Return one row for each TV & Video product with a competitor check. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "product_id",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
